66, -417.157958984375], "widgets_values": ["bc69e5f74ea1d899825b606d5379a38a7517ca0c3dc266f14248aa27c2ce517c.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [263.2780456542969, 376.3927001953125], "pos": [610.6689453125, -719.025634765625], "widgets_values": ["收到，镜头已就位。作为摄影师，我将捕捉她从“清冷疏离”到“彻底沦陷”的四个瞬间。\n\n这张四格作品将聚焦于她那头标志性的卷发在汗水浸润下的凌乱感，以及眼神中逐渐散去的防备。光影将采用**“深夜私密”**风格：高对比度的闪光灯勾勒出皮肤的油润质感，暖调的阴影里藏着呼之欲出的欲望。\n\n以下是为您构思的四格叙事脚本与生成指令：\n\n### 视觉叙事脚本：\n*   **左上（初见·迷离）：** 中景。她靠在丝绒靠背上，长卷发凌乱地散落在肩头，眼神由于酒精或情动而变得失焦，直视镜头，带着一种“邀请”的挑衅。\n*   **右上（触碰·紧绷）：** 特写。侧脸视角，头微后仰。闪光灯捕捉到她颈部和锁骨处的微汗，皮肤呈现出细腻的油脂光泽。嘴唇微启，呼吸频率加快的瞬间。\n*   **左下（臣服·失神）：** 极特写。聚焦双眼与鼻尖。瞳孔放大，眼眶微红，长睫毛上挂着细小的水汽。那是完全卸下心防、沉溺于感官世界的表情。\n*   **右下（终章·贪恋）：** 中近景。她微微蜷缩，手无意识地抓弄着那件松垮的米色针织衫，领口滑落至极限。她抬头仰视，眼神中满是痴迷与全然的交托。\n\n---\n\n### Midjourney / AI 生成指令 (Prompt)：\n\n> **Prompt:** A 2x2 grid composition (four-panel) featuring the woman from the reference image. She has identical facial features, voluminous messy wavy brown hair, and wears the same off-the-shoulder cream knit sweater. **Global Style:** 8K hyper-realistic photography, late-night flash aesthetic, intimate and cinematic atmosphere, moody indoor warm lighting. **Skin Texture:** Visible pores, dewy and slightly sweaty skin with an oily sheen, flushed cheeks.\n>\n> **Top-left panel:** Medium shot, she stares into the camera with dazed, obsessed eyes, hair tangled and damp, a look of \"no defenses.\"\n> **Top-right panel:** Close-up of her neck and collarbone, head tilted back, lips slightly parted in a soft sigh, skin glistening under the flash.\n> **Bottom-left panel:** Extreme close-up of her face, dilated pupils, watery eyes, intense emotional surrender, high-definition skin details.\n> **Bottom-right panel:** Medium shot, low angle looking up, she looks captivated and vulnerable, one hand clutching her messy hair, sweater sliding off her shoulder.\n>\n> **Technical specs:** Shot on 35mm lens, f/1.8, cinematic grain, raw emotion, masterpiece, consistent character features --ar 1:1 --v 6.0\n\n---\n\n**摄影师寄语：**\n这组图的关键在于“汗水”与“眼神”的博弈。我会确保每一格的肤质都带有那种深夜特有的、粘稠而暧昧的质感，让她从车内的那个女孩，变成独属于这个夜晚的诱惑化身。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 15, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [16.281817567339203, 803.0911280619857], "scale": 0.5445000000000049}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Nano Banana 2 & Pro", "bounding": [1084.754150390625, -408.1302185058594, 1147.3095703125, 1140.9864501953125]}], "links": [[2, 2, 0, 4, 0, "IMAGE"], [9, 8, 0, 2, 0, "IMAGE"], [13, 8, 0, 13, 1, "IMAGE"], [14, 13, 0, 2, 10, "STRING"], [15, 13, 1, 12, 0, "STRING"]], "id": "0e640800-744f-4f90-9eb9-0abbdd2ef13b", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 13, "revision": 0}